WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.902
&gt;&gt;&gt; This just into CNN.

00:00:08.035 --> 00:00:08.669
Former vice president Mike pence

00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:11.005
just addressed the classified

00:00:11.138 --> 00:00:11.739
documents that were found in his

00:00:11.872 --> 00:00:14.108
home.

00:00:14.241 --> 00:00:15.676
&gt;&gt; It's actually been a very

00:00:15.809 --> 00:00:20.881
humbling week for us.

00:00:21.015 --> 00:00:23.417
But I know we did the right

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:23.884
thing.

00:00:24.018 --> 00:00:26.687
Look, the proper handling of

00:00:26.787 --> 00:00:31.525
classiied information is very

00:00:31.659 --> 00:00:33.193
important to the national

00:00:33.327 --> 00:00:34.695
interest.

00:00:34.828 --> 00:00:35.362
Throughout my career in the

00:00:35.496 --> 00:00:35.996
congress and as your vice

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:38.165
president, we always sought to

00:00:38.299 --> 00:00:39.500
take great care in the handling

00:00:39.633 --> 00:00:41.168
of the nation's secrets.

00:00:41.302 --> 00:00:42.169
At the close of our

00:00:42.303 --> 00:00:44.138
administration, we did a

00:00:44.271 --> 00:00:48.943
thorough review of all the

00:00:49.076 --> 00:00:50.077
documents and the possessions in

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:50.711
the office of the vice

00:00:50.811 --> 00:00:52.713
president, and the residence of

00:00:52.713 --> 00:00:53.347
the vice president.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:58.719
I'm confident that was conducted

00:00:58.719 --> 00:00:59.153
in a professional manner, but

00:00:59.286 --> 00:01:01.755
with news in recent weeks of

00:01:01.889 --> 00:01:04.725
repeated disclosure of

00:01:04.758 --> 00:01:05.893
classified documents in a

00:01:06.026 --> 00:01:08.095
personal residence of president

00:01:08.228 --> 00:01:09.029
Biden, and documents dating back

00:01:09.163 --> 00:01:09.897
to his service as vice

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:16.203
president, I simply thought, out

00:01:16.337 --> 00:01:16.937
of an abundance of caution, it

00:01:17.071 --> 00:01:17.671
would be appropriate to review

00:01:17.805 --> 00:01:19.773
my personal records kept at our

00:01:19.907 --> 00:01:21.408
residence at the state of

00:01:21.542 --> 00:01:21.742
Indiana.

00:01:21.875 --> 00:01:25.479
We initiated that process.

00:01:25.612 --> 00:01:26.747
Along the way, we determined

00:01:26.847 --> 00:01:28.916
that there was a small number of

00:01:29.049 --> 00:01:32.753
documents marked classified or

00:01:32.886 --> 00:01:34.388
sensitive interspersed in my

00:01:34.755 --> 00:01:36.390
personal papers.

00:01:36.757 --> 00:01:37.958
Upon making that discovery, we

00:01:38.092 --> 00:01:42.763
secured those documents

00:01:42.763 --> 00:01:42.997
immediately.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:43.597
We alerted the national

00:01:43.731 --> 00:01:43.964
archives.

00:01:44.098 --> 00:01:46.433
We turned them over to the FBI,

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:47.201
and soon thereafter communicated

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:51.572
it to congress.

00:01:51.705 --> 00:01:52.306
While I was not aware that those

00:01:52.439 --> 00:01:54.141
classified documents were in our

00:01:54.274 --> 00:01:57.845
personal residence, let me be

00:01:57.978 --> 00:01:58.145
clear.

00:01:58.278 --> 00:02:00.414
Those classified documents

00:02:00.781 --> 00:02:01.081
should not have been at my

00:02:01.215 --> 00:02:01.849
personal residence.

00:02:01.982 --> 00:02:07.121
Mistakes were made, and I take

00:02:07.254 --> 00:02:08.789
full responsibility.

00:02:08.789 --> 00:02:10.791
I've directed by counsel to work

00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:13.160
with the national archives, with

00:02:13.293 --> 00:02:14.795
the department of justice, and

00:02:14.895 --> 00:02:16.196
with the congress to fully

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:19.566
cooperate in any investigation.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.300
Our national security depends on

00:02:20.434 --> 00:02:24.004
the proper handling of

00:02:24.138 --> 00:02:26.040
classified and sensitive

00:02:26.173 --> 00:02:27.307
materials, and I -- I know that

00:02:27.441 --> 00:02:29.810
when errors are made, it's

00:02:29.943 --> 00:02:31.145
important that they be resolved

00:02:31.278 --> 00:02:34.481
swiftly and disclosed.

00:02:34.815 --> 00:02:36.183
My only hope is that as the

00:02:36.316 --> 00:02:37.017
American people look at our

00:02:37.151 --> 00:02:38.819
conduct in this manner, that

00:02:38.819 --> 00:02:41.488
they see that we acted above

00:02:41.622 --> 00:02:43.757
politics, and put the national

